Requested panel results are recorded in `verification/SDT-SITTER-UI-PANEL.md`.
Follow-up proposals, not an accessibility approval: stable accessible button
name and reduced-motion support; transition-only status announcements; verify
keyboard opening, focus, closing/Escape and focus return; human-readable states
and document title/filename; distinguish complete coverage from finished passes
with exceptions; move technical diagnostics below primary progress information.

Before implementation, verify remaining visual and assistive-technology claims
in a real window. The existing DOM/style smoke does not establish keyboard or
screen-reader behavior. The finish-estimate overrun finding was addressed in
